      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaverdale%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The CDP straddles Summerhill Township and spills into Adams Township, giving it a unique dual‑township character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
