      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaverdale%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Beaverdale Public Library’s garden showcases replicas of historic coal‑mining equipment, a nod to the town’s mining past.",
